# Development Workflow

Always check `{{docsDir}}/` before implementing features.

## Phase Documentation

Phase docs live in `{{docsDir}}/`:
- `requirements/` — What to build and why
- `design/` — How to build it
- `planning/` — Task breakdown
- `testing/` — Test strategy and coverage

## Code Quality Rules

- Write self-documenting code; avoid redundant comments
- Only add error handling for real, possible failures
- No speculative features beyond stated requirements
- Three similar lines is better than a premature abstraction

## Before Starting Any Task

1. Read the relevant `{{docsDir}}/` docs
2. Confirm your understanding with the user if unclear
3. Implement, then update docs with any decisions made
